{"createdAt":"2026-09-30T12:11:11.270Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"I've often heard people say "},{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":["p1"],"text":"HTML"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" is a programming language, but I've been told otherwise about a hundred times."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"link","href":"/en/misc/html/"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p6","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"To be honest, I thought so myself until recently."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p8","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p7","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"However, in text files like HTML or Markdown, you can't define what happens when you press a button. You also can't do conditional branching."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pa","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p9","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"What is a markup language"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pc","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pb","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"A markup language is a text file that, when opened in a browser, can embed information about which parts are headings, which are bold, where to break lines, and how it relates to other documents."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pe","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pd","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"There are many articles arguing that HTML is not a programming language, so you might want to check those out."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"People often call it a markup language; isn't it a programming language?","emoji":"🗒️","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":false,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2025-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","title":"Markup Languages","translation":{"automatic":true,"sourceId":"01M3S3KKZME6NF4QEC9VWZG9RF"}},"id":"01M3S3KN16A6NRC1EN9FK1GEYS","locale":"en","publishedAt":"2025-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"markup","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98","label":"Miscellaneous","locale":"en","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"misc","translationGroup":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9P9QVX3HS9J0D0SDRD90","label":"coding","locale":"en","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"coding","translationGroup":"01M40J9P9QVX3HS9J0D0SDRD90"},{"id":"01M40J9Q9ZTBA6GQGRV3E9D2YK","label":"dev","locale":"en","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"dev","translationGroup":"01M40J9Q9ZTBA6GQGRV3E9D2YK"}]},"translationGroup":"01M3S3KKZME6NF4QEC9VWZG9RF"}
